      {
        "dom_id": "step-154006",
        "name": "Example: \n                    Proving Parity of Non-Linear Expressions",
        "problem": "Suppose $n=4m^2+2m-1,$ where $m \\in \\mathbb{Z}.$ Construct an argument that explains why $n$ is odd.",
        "worked_solution": "An integer is *odd* if it can be written as $2a + 1,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nNow, note the following regarding the expression $4m^2+2m-1{:}$\n\n- All terms, apart from the constant term, have a common factor of $2.$\n\n- The constant term can be written as $-1 = -2+1.$\n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\textrm{odd}}$ since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =4{m}^{2}+2m-1 \\\\  & =(4{m}^{2}+2m-2)+1 \\\\  & =2({{2{m}^{2}+m-1}_{⏟}}_{a})+1 \\\\  & =2a+1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $a=\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}2m^2+m-1}$ is an integer.",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-154006\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"154006\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"13300\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-154006\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-12\">Proving Parity of Non-Linear Expressions</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"154006\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Suppose <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"19.443ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 8371.4 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">n=4m^2+2m-1,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<p