      {
        "dom_id": "step-154009",
        "name": "Example: \n                    Proving Parity of Non-Linear Expressions With Multiple Variables",
        "problem": "Suppose $n=2pq - 4q + 5,$ where $p,q \\in \\mathbb{Z}.$ Construct an argument that explains why $n$ is odd.",
        "worked_solution": "An integer is *odd* if it can be written as $2a + 1,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nNow, note the following regarding the expression $2pq - 4q + 5 {:}$\n\n- All terms, apart from the constant term, have a common factor of $2.$\n\n- The constant term can be written as $5 = 4+1.$\n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\textrm{odd}}$ since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =2pq-4q+5 \\\\  & =(2pq-4q+4)+1 \\\\  & =2({{pq-2q+2}_{⏟}}_{a})+1 \\\\  & =2a+1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $a= \\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue} pq - 2q + 2\\in \\mathbb Z }.$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-154009\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"154009\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"13302\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-154009\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-15\">Proving Parity of Non-Linear Expressions With Multiple Variables</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"154009\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            ma