46 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"890\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"1390\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"2213\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"3213\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3714\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"4381\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"5437\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5938,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-61\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"6467\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>So, since <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.56ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2824.4 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">8n-4</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-38\" d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q1