605L417 512Q408 500 387 472T360 435T339 403T319 367T305 330T292 284T284 230T278 162T275 80Q275 66 275 52T274 28V19Q270 2 255 -10T221 -22Q210 -22 200 -19T179 0T168 40Q168 198 265 368Q285 400 349 489L395 552H302Q128 552 119 546Q113 543 108 522T98 479L95 458V455H55V458Z\" id=\"E17-MJMAIN-37\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMAIN-34\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1323\" xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMAIN-2B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2323\" xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMAIN-37\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> can be written in the form <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-18-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.343ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2753.4 1008.6\" width=\"6.395ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-18-Title\">2{\\color{blue}{a}}+1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\" id=\"E18-MJMAIN-32\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\" id=\"E18-MJMATHI-61\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\" id=\"E18-MJMAIN-2B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\" id=\"E18-MJMAIN-31\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-32\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(500,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-61\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<use x=\"1252\" xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-2B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2252\" xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-31\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> where <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -576.1 529.5 721.6\" width=\"1.23ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\">{\\color{blue}{a}}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\" id=\"E19-MJMATHI-61\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMATHI-61\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is an integer, we conclude that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.343ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2824.4 1008.6\" width=\"6.56ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">4n+7</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\" id=\"E20-MJMAIN-34\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M21 287Q22 293 24 303T36 341T56 388T89 425T135 442Q171 442 195 424T225 390T231 369Q231 367 232 367L243 378Q304 442 382 442Q436 442 469 415T503 336T465 179T427 52Q427 26 444 26Q450 26 453 27Q482 32 505 65T540 145Q542 153 560 153Q580 153 580 145Q580 144 576 130Q568 101 554 73T508 17T439 -10Q392 -10 371 17T350 73Q350 92 386 193T423 345Q423 404 379 404H374Q288 404 229 303L222 291L189 157Q156 26 151 16Q138 -11 108 -11Q95 -11 87 -5T76 7T74 17Q74 30 112 180T152 343Q153 348 153 366Q153 405 129 405Q91 405 66 305Q60 285 60 284Q58 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\" id=\"E20-MJMATHI-6E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\" id=\"E20-MJMAIN-2B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 458Q56 460 72 567L88 674Q88 676 108 676H128V672Q128 662 143 655T195 646T364 644H485V605L417 512Q408 500 387 472T360 435T339 403T319 367T305 330T292 284T284 230T278 162T275 80Q275 66 275 52T274 28V19Q270 2 255 -10T221 -22Q210 -22 200 -19T179 0T168 40Q168 198 265 368Q285 400 349 489L395 552H302Q128 552 119 546Q113 543 108 522T98 479L95 458V455H55V458Z\" id=\"E20-MJMAIN-37\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMAIN-34\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1323\" xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMAIN-2B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2323\" xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMAIN-37\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is odd <em>for all</em> <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2769.6 936.9\" width=\"6.433ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">n\\in\\mathbb Z.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M21 287Q22 293 24 303T36 341T56 388T89 425T135 442Q171 442 195 424T225 390T231 369Q231 367 232 367L243 378Q304 442 382 442Q436 442 469 415T503 336T465 179T427 52Q427 26 444 26Q450 26 453 27Q482 32 505 65T540 145Q542 153 560 153Q580 153 580 145Q580 144 576 130Q568 101 554 73T508 17T439 -10Q392 -10 371 17T350 73Q350 92 386 193T423 345Q423 404 379 404H374Q288 404 229 303L222 291L18